Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸想让我们继承他的事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things. The family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击者是一名白人男子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their attacker, a white male, 24 to 30 years of age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是一幅好画面 - 变形人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not a good picture. - Shapeshifter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每一种文化里都有变形人的传说 - 它们可以变成任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Every culture has a shapeshifter. - Something that looks like anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze. Stay on your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他已经被怀疑是杀人凶手 - 杀人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's been held on suspicion of murder. - Murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在是在市中心的密尔沃基银行前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here downtown in front of the City Bank of Milwaukee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在几分钟前这里发生了短暂的交火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and though a short exchange of gunfire occurred minutes ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们到达之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}police and SWAT teams maintain position…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察和特警已经包围了三个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we enter the third hour of this intense standoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,专家估计仍有大约十名人质被困在银行里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities estimate as many as 10 hostages are being held inside the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止还没有关于嫌犯身份的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No word as yet on the identity of the suspects or-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有动静了 呆在原地 - 似乎有什么事发生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming out. Hold your position! - Something's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们正在开门 罗杰 你拍到了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're opening the door. Roger, are you getting this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 把镜头转到那边去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostage coming out. Stand down. Stand down. Hold fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't shoot. Don't shoot. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 想都别想 都给我退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Don't even think about it. Get the hell back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当FBI是种什么感觉？怎么说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it like, being an FBI guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要保守秘密 很多秘密 数都数不过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the secrets we gotta keep. Oh, God, the secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最大的问题是 孤独{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly, it's lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我完全同意 - 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I so know what you mean. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,海琳娜是我们的老顾客了 她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena was our head buyer. She…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:02:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就象我们的家人 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was family, you know? She said it herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年圣诞节晚会上她都这么说 说我们是她唯一的亲人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Christmas party she said we were the only family she had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没有任何迹象表明她会做那样的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were no signs that she'd do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有… 直到现在我也不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I still can't believe it, even now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上 海琳娜在关门后又回到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night, Helena came back to the store after closing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走了展柜还有保险箱里所有的珠宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleaned out all the display cases and the safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好被我们这儿值夜班的 安格儿发现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar, our night watchman, he caught her in the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道该怎么办 他们认识了那么久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know what to do. He'd known her for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他给我打了个电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called me at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那时她抢走了他的枪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when she took his gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着他的脑门就是一枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shot him in the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.73,0:02:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电话里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard him die…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她的动机是什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what her motive could've been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,动机？这根本就很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What motive? It makes no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么偷了所有的珠宝与钻石 仅仅是把它们藏起来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why steal all those diamonds, jewelry, then what, just dump it somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后回家 接着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hide it and then go home and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自杀了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed herself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察说电吹风掉进了浴缸里 把自己电死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops said she dropped a hairdryer in the bath and fried herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该知道 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢你 弗兰尼 我想这些就是我想要了解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks, Frannie. Think that's all I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我的意思是 如果我知道的更多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I mean, because I've got more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 如果你还有问题想问我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you wanted to interview me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天 我们私下里谈谈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometime, in private?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 这真是个不错的注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I think that's a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个好公民 真的 为什么不把你的电话号码写在这儿给我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a true patriot, you really are. Why don't you write your number down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说你自己从没看过监控录像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you never saw the security camera footage yourself, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察一来就把所有带子都带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police, they took all the tapes, first thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at your file, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死警察 - 那是他们的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Frigging cops. - They're just doing their job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他们是在做我们的工作 他们不知道自己在干什么 弄得一团糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're doing our job. Only they don't know it, so they suck at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我说说那家银行 - 密尔沃基国家银行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talk to me about this bank. - Milwaukee National Trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大约一个月前曾被抢 - 和M。-O。-As珠宝店一样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was hit a month ago. - Same M.O. as the jewelry store?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一个干了很久的职员 「十年如一日」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside job, long-time employee. The never-in-a-million-years type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙抢劫了银行 然后回家 并按照推测同样自杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude robs the bank, then goes home and supposedly commits suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗斯尼克的工作是警卫？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reznick was the guard on duty? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事实上他被来抢劫的出纳员给打晕了 - 天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was beaten unconscious by the teller who heisted the place. - God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯尼克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Reznick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗纳德·罗斯尼克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Reznick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联邦调查局的 罗斯尼克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI, Mr. Reznick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看下你们的证件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see the badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.69,0:04:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把我知道的都告诉警方了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already gave my statement to the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 罗纳德 只是一些关于你的陈述的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen Ronald, just some things about your statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想从你的话中澄清一些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want some clarification on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们看过了？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You read it? - Sure did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要听听我的说法？- 这就是我们来这儿的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come to listen to what I gotta say? - That's why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧… 进来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我把真相告诉警察以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the cops ever called me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就再没找过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after I told them what was really going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都认为我疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all thought I was crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 胡安·莫拉瑞斯 没有抢劫密尔沃基国家银行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First off, Juan Morales never robbed the Milwaukee National Trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I guarantee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和胡安是朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Juan were friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他常在我值夜班的时候来找我 一起玩牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used to come back to the bank on my night shifts and we'd play cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那天晚上你让他进入了银行 在非营业时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you let him into the bank that night. After hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让进入银行的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing I let into the bank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是胡安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't Juan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说 它和胡安长的一样 但是那却不是他本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it had his face, but it wasn't his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个细节都那么完美 但太完美了 就像制作出来的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every detail was perfect but too perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我在和一个 胡安 的模型说话一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like if a doll maker made it, like, if I was talking to a big Juan doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个胡安的模型？- 知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A "Juan doll"? - Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事不是第一次发生了 那次的珠宝店也发生过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't the only time. There was this jewelry store too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察和你们这些人… 你们只是没看见罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the cops and you guys, I mean, you just won't see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,两件案件都是被同一个东西干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both crimes were pulled by the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么… 那个东西是什么 雷斯尼克先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's that, Mr. Reznick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国人已经研究好多年了 之前俄国人也研究过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese been working on them and the Russians before that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,半人身半机械{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part man, part machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一样 但是这个却是能变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Terminator but the kind that can change itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成看起来和其他人一样的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make itself look like others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就从前的T2 - 完全正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like from T2. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以并不仅仅是个机器人 更像是个… 类人机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, not just a robot. More of a "mandroid."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个类人机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mandroid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你如此肯定的 罗纳德？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you so sure about this, Ronald?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我复制了所有的保安监视带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I made copies of all the security tapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一旦到了警察手中 就拿不回来了 这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew once the cops got them they'd be buried. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.63,0:06:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他 看 快看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him, watch, watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Look, there it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗？他有一双激光眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, he's got the laser eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察说那是某种光线反射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops said it was some kind of reflected light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种「红眼」 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of "camera flare." Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不是该死的红眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aingt no damn camera flare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我个是精神创伤后的反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say I'm a post-trauma case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？银行解雇了我 这没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? Bank goes and fires me? It don't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可那个类人机器人还在逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mandroid is still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果法律不能将这东西绳之于法的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The law won't hunt this thing down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲自动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 这个东西杀害了真正的人类 还伪装成自杀的现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, this thing, it kills the real person. Makes it look like a suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后它就变形成那个人的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it, like, morphs into the person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作一段时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cases the job for a while till it knows the take is fat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再找机会下手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then finds its opening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些抢劫案都发生在这附近{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These robberies, they're grouped together. So I figure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我认为那个类人机器人藏身在中间的某个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mandroid is holed up in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是地下 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underground maybe. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也… 也许那是他给自己电池充电的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's where it recharges its mandroid batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你仔细听好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to listen very carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要告诉你这所有事情的真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm about to tell you the gods' honest truth about all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并没有像类人机器人一样的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as mandroids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有鬼怪或者非人类的东西 只是人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing evil or inhuman going on out there. Just people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有别的 明白么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing else, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 激光眼 那只是红眼 - 罗斯尼克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The laser eyes. - Just a camera flare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你并不想相信这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't wanna believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但确实是你的朋友胡安抢劫了银行 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your friend robbed the bank and that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过得等我办完一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟 你也太直接了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that has got to be the kicker, straight up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你告诉那个可怜的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell that poor son of a bitch that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说的？要去收回他拷贝的带子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say? Remand the tapes that he copied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「进行中案件的机密证据」？简直胡说八道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classified evidence of an ongoing investigation? That's messed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么 生我的气了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you pissed at me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得你变成 这样好的一个联邦调查员感到很惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's creepy how good of a fed you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以透露点消息给这家伙 他做了一些不错的前期工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could've thrown the guy a bone. He did some pretty good legwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「类人机器人」？- 除了类人机器人那部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mandroid? - Except for the mandroid part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢他 他与我们两个没有太多的不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked him. He's not that different from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人们认为我们都是疯子 - 但他并不是个猎鬼者 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- People think we're crazy. - He's not a hunter.Dene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是一个意外发现了真相的普通人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a guy who stumbled onto something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他去对付那家伙 他会被撕碎的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he went up against this, he'd get torn apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道真相的话可能更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better to stay in the dark and stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 你说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shapeshifter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像回到圣路易斯一样 在录象中同样的视网膜反射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like back at St. Louis. Same retinal reaction to video.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,像相机的红眼现象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes flare at the camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恨这些该死的东西 - 你以为我不恨吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate those frigging things. - You think I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又没变成你的样子杀人 陷害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One didn't turn into you and frame you for murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个变形者和我们在密苏里 杀掉那个一样的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if this shifter's anything like the one in Missouri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么罗纳德说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Ronald's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他们喜欢在地下活动 下水道是个好选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They like to lair up underground. Preferably the sewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前所有的抢劫地点都是连在一起的 通过… 主下水道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the robberies are connected so far to the sewer main layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个主下水道上还有一家银行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one more bank lined up on that sewer main.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.92,0:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的系统还没有发现任何问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had any flags go up on our system yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是整个系统的一个小故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is a glitch in the overall grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想保证银行的监控器没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanna make sure the branch monitors are kosher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想事后追悔不如事前稳妥 - 就是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better to be safe than sorry. - That's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了 你们还需要其他帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty. You guys need anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我们很快搞定 只是个例行检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we'll be in and out before you know it. A routine check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey-dokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢他 他说「没有问题」 - 如果他是变形者呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like him. He says okey-dokey. - What if he's the shifter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我们就跟踪他回家 然后用一颗银弹射穿他的胸腔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we follow him home and put a silver bullet through his chest plate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 有爆米花吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Got any popcorn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是「没有问题」先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like Mr. Okey-dokey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is okey-dokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们行动过早了 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we jumped the gun on this, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至都不知道他在不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know it's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们就应该去下水道… 去… 去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should just go on back to the sewers and-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:11:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们应该寻找的是眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to be looking for eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正要看眼睛呢 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm getting there. - Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 畸形人 - 找到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, freak. - Got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Ronald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是抢劫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a robbery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人现在都给我趴在地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody on the floor now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 该死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down, damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 趴在地上 趴在地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, on the floor, on the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,到中间去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:12:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴到中间的地上 到中间去 趴在地上 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the floor in the middle. In the middle, on the floor. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们不应该带枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said we shouldn't bring guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道会发生这事 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know this was gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找他谈谈 我认为他不喜欢你 约翰逊联邦调查员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do the talking. I don't think he likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有一条进出的通道 我把它用链子栓住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's only one way in or out of here and I chained it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没有人可以离开 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nobody's leaving, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不冷静下来 冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you calm down? Just calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴在地上 马上 - 好的 我们照做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get on the floor now. - Okay, we're doing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是别杀任何人 特别是我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't shoot anybody. Especially us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 你们俩一走我就知道 你们不是联邦调查员 你们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. As soon as you two left. You aingt FBI. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为谁工作？你们是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for? The Men in Black?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们为类人机器人工作？- 我们不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You working for the mandroid? - We're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴 我没问你 我不喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut up! I aingt talking to you, I don't like you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边去 搜搜他们 看他们有没有武器 去啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over there, frisk them down, make sure they got no weapons. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们找到了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会什么都不带就来干活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna walk in here naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别 别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你不想伤害任何人 但是如果你一直晃那把枪就难说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna hurt anybody, but it will happen if you keep waving that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么不放这些人走呢？- 不 我已经告诉你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you let these people go? - No! I told you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有人来制止这那个东西 我就会亲自动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if nobody's gonna stop this thing, then I gotta do it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们相信你 所以我们才会到这儿来 - 你并不相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We believe you. That's why we're here. - You don't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody believes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能会相信？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着枪呢 老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the gun, boss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随时开枪 我只是想告诉你一些事情 到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're calling the shots. I wanna tell you something.Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是银行经理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bank manager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们为什么会装成这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think we got these getups?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直都在后面监视着银行 我们看到银行经理了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were monitoring the cameras. We saw the manager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看到了他的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的激光眼？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His laser eyes? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我们没有时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.No. We're running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要在他变成其他人的样子前找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find him before he changes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好象我会相信你一样 你是个可恶的骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm gonna listen to you. You're a damn liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开枪的 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shoot you. Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓我 抓我当你的人质 但是我们必须快点行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me, take me with you as a hostage. But we gotta act fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们在这浪费的时间越长 他就有越多的时间去变形{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer we sit here, the more time he has to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.33,0:14:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是个疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家银行里面的确有些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There really is something inside this bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你和我一起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他所有人都到保险库去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everyone else gets in the vault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Move, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.49,0:15:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你把它锁上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move. And you lock it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 大家… 尽量保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, everyone. Just stay cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,旋转把手 旋转那的把手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spin that. Spin that door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.98,0:15:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真勇敢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is so brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:16:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查桌子后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check behind the desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼的这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他变形的时候 他会脱掉旧皮 所以 现在它可能是任何一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it changes form, it sheds its old skin, so now it could be anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇异了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它的机器皮肤太像真的了 - 好了 我们现在实话实说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Its robot skin is so lifelike. - Let's get something straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是个类人机器人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a mandroid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是个变形者 - 变形者？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a Shapeshifter. Yeah. - Shapeshifter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是人类 多多少少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's human, more or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有人类的某些特性 在这情况下 是钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has human drives. In this case, it's money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它培育自己的皮肤 他可以把皮肤变形成其他人的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it generates its own skin. Shape it to match someone else's features.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以它… - 它杀某些人然后取代那些人的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tall or short, male…It kills someone and takes their place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀人 我看倒没这必要 - 你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kills or doesn't, I don't think it matters. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得狼人的传说吗？和那些家伙很像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the old werewolf stories? Pretty much came from these guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,银制物品是唯一可以制服它们的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver is the only thing I've seen that hurts them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点 我们走 离开这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, let's move. Move out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 快点 加快速度 速度 速度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on, let's hustle, hustle, hustle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样了？- 和以往差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How we doing? - Another day in paradise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还没有人出来？- 这家伙把自己锁里面了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one's come out yet? - This guy locked himself in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进去做的第一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first thing he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 切断电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Cut the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了？- 正是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you nuts? - That's just it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我很怕丢了小命 但这居然是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was so scared that I was losing my marbles. But this is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 我是对的 除了变形人这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was right. Except for the mandroid thing. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 不要放在心上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't mention it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 不 不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们切断了电力 大概这是他们跟我们说「你好」的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut the power. It's their way of saying hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为罪犯你还真是缺乏经验 罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't exactly a smooth criminal about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至连警卫都没看管 他大概通知了警方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't secure the security guard, He probably called them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没想到 - 等等 让我们先稳定一下情绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't think to-Hang on. Let's breathe, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许把我们包围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably got us surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们切断了摄像头的电力 所以现在没有办法告诉我们谁才是变形人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut the power to the cameras. No way of telling who the Shapeshifter is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去不怎么好 罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not looking good, Ron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你兄弟是不是总是那么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has your brother always been so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wonderful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 骗开那把枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, staring down that gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后摸透了那个变态家伙的想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the way he played into that psycho's crazy head…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说些他爱听的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}telling him what he wanted to hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他简直就是个英雄 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's like a real hero or something. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你救了我们 你救了我们 - 事实上是我发现了一些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saved us. You saved us. - I just found a few more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.20,0:20:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 伙计们 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, everybody, let's go. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么？- 萨姆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和 罗纳德 要和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald and I need to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它又蜕皮了 不知道什么时候 可能在大厅或是进地下室的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shed its skin again. We don't know. Could be in the halls, the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道吗 迪恩 你正被警方通缉 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, you are wanted by the police. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们找到那可恶的东西 我们怎么才能从这该死的地方逃出去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we do find this damn thing, how are we gonna get out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的问题是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One problem at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要监视这里所有的地方 看看能不能找到异类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do a sweep of the place, find any stragglers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后把大家都聚在一起 就可以玩「找怪物」的游戏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we got everybody, we play a game of Find the Freaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里 我找到了另一把给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here. I found another one of these for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在这里 确保 罗纳德不会伤害任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here, make sure Ronald doesn't hurt anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着他… - 看着他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help him manage the situation. - Help him manage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发神经病吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道这不是我们喜欢的方式 - 这叫什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't going the way we wanted. - Understatement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一旦警察进来 罗纳德和我们被逮捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we let the cops in now, Ronald gets arrested, we get arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,变形人就会跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shifter gets away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.36,0:21:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能再也找不到他了 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably never find it again, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别暴露在光亮下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会来真的吧？- 罗纳德的计划是个白痴计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Ron's game plan was a bad plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过有一点疯狂 但现在 是这城市的疯狂 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little bit of a crazy plan. But right now crazy is the only game in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Ronald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让这开着 给你们些新鲜空气好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep this open, get you some fresh air in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人可以离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no one leaves this vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.33,0:23:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 你们为什么要帮他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. Why are you helping him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你也不会相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me if I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好？我想我不得不离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - I think I gotta get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 我非常抱歉 你还是得待在这里 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, I'm sorry but you gotta stay put. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思？条件？- 罗纳德…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, demands? - Ron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.39,0:23:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挂上电话 - 我不是抢匪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang up. - I'm not a bank robber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.89,0:23:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的要离开这里 - 先生 你不能走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta get out of here. - You can't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是打击罪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of a crime fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亨利 深呼吸 好吗？- 罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, just breathe, okay? - Ronald!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 - 不 我一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look-No, I'm acting alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.03,0:23:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗纳德…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.99,0:23:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警察知道的越少越好 - 我想这位老兄的心脏病发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The less the cops know, the better. - This dude's having a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要么是我们的人 要么是骗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Could be our guy, could be a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想让他死？- 没有人会死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you just gonna let the man die? - No one's dying here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.63,0:23:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我有多少人质被劫持？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me how many hostages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.55,0:23:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有人心脏病复发了 你们得派个急救人员来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One could be having heart trouble. You need to send in a paramedic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.05,0:23:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持冷静 我让你们出来 - 进来个急救人员 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just stay calm, we'll have you out…Send in a paramedic.okye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.22,0:24:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要耍花招 听见了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try anything else. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.73,0:24:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救人员？他已经没有时间等了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paramedic? Guy don't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很抱歉 但是没有人可以离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm sorry. Okay? I am. But nobody's getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会死在你的面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dying right in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计 你可以打开前门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. You gotta unlock the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.28,0:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以让他走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都站在那里别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you, stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.04,0:25:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白什么 罗纳德？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Ronald…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.75,0:25:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是对的 我们让他出去 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's right. We gotta get this man outside. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扶你 我来帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我来就行 真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got him. It's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.13,0:25:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心脚下 - 谢谢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step. Sure. - Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.93,0:25:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.98,0:25:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我能和你谈谈吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I talk to you for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你说了算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the gun, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.99,0:25:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, come back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.75,0:25:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 罗纳德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down, Ron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.49,0:26:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位注意 我们有5到12名人质…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units be advised, we have five to 12 hostages…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.79,0:26:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在城市银行的密尔布拉德利中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the City Bank of Milwaukee Bradley Center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, go. Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.01,0:26:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.51,0:26:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心狙击手 我去追变形者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of the guard. I'm going after the shifter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.36,0:27:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Ron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干的很好 非常棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did a real good job tracking this thing. You really did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.44,0:27:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝啊 请别伤害我们 - 你们这个时候不应该到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! Please don't hurt us. - You shouldn't be back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.07,0:27:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很危险 回到保险库里去 现在就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in danger. Now go back to the vault. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.99,0:27:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,人质在银行中心…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hostages in the City Bank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.08,0:27:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will all be over soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候通知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by for further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.75,0:27:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会没事的 - 别开枪 别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything's gonna be all right. - Hey, don't shoot. Don't shoot, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.51,0:28:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.43,0:28:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.39,0:28:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 马上退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, get back, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来的人质之一现在掌控局势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the hostages, he seems to have taken over the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.15,0:28:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.28,0:28:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so screwed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.29,0:28:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 他又脱皮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - He's slipped his skin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.46,0:28:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 是的 这混蛋变形的很快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah, bastard shifts fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,比圣路易斯那个快多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster than the one in St. Louis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢玩蒙面游戏 它又有可能是任何一个人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like playing a shell game. Could be anybody again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.64,0:28:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想大多数的职员都在保险库里 - 你仔细搜索这每一个角落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The employees are out of the vault. - You search every inch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.01,0:28:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去把大家都集中起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll round everybody up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.87,0:29:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crap. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.66,0:29:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局的人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The feds are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.87,0:29:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦… 真该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗巴斯中尉 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lieutenant Robards. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.84,0:29:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别调查员 汉迪克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Agent Henriksen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 下一句是我来接管 但还要求我们全力配合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. You're lead dog now, but you'd just love my full cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.01,0:29:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的不管你做什么 你可以去买个甜圈吃或者回你老婆的被窝里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a rat's ass what you do. Get a doughnut and bang your wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.56,0:29:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要的是你的特别行动小组全副武装待命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do need is your SWAT team, locked and loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.56,0:29:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 特别调查员 这个案件有些不对头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, agent, something's not right about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.86,0:29:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这并不像一个普通的抢劫案 - 那是因为这根本就不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not going down like a usual heist. - That's because it isn't one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.69,0:29:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不知道你在跟谁打交道 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what you're dealing with, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个银行里面有一个怪物 罗巴斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a monster in that bank, Robards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是一个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought you were one of the good guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.56,0:30:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？- 你为什么关心这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Why would you care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.02,0:30:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫 迪恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.11,0:30:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 雪莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sherri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 雪莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sherri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.83,0:30:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好起来的 这所有的一切很快就会结束的 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be all right. This will all be over soon, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.59,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪位？- 我是特别调查员 威克特 汉迪克森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - This is Special Agent Victor Henriksen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.26,0:30:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没有谈判的心情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, listen, I'm not in the negotiating mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我也没有 我本来是想让你活着走出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither. It's my job to bring you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.81,0:30:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着的惊喜 现在看来没必要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive's a bonus, but not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.23,0:30:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话从联邦调查员嘴里说出来真荒唐 你不这么认为吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of harsh for a fed, don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.94,0:31:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不是普通的罪犯 对吗 迪恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the typical suspect, are you, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.94,0:31:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你和萨姆放下武器出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you and Sam out here, unarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.44,0:31:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们就进去 是的 我知道萨姆 你的古怪兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we come in. And yes, I know about Sam too. Bonnie to your Clyde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.45,0:31:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 部分正确 但是你们怎么会知道我们在这儿的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that part's true. But how'd you know we were here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.32,0:31:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己好好想想 那才是原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go screw yourself. That's how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.08,0:31:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解你已经成为我的工作了 迪恩 我已经找你好几个星期了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's become my job to know about you. I've been looking for you for weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.33,0:31:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道圣路易斯的谋杀案 也知道你在巴尔的摩耍的戏法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about the murder in St. Louis, the Houdini act in Baltimore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.88,0:31:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你妖鬼神灵欺骗人的谎言 我还知道你的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about the desecrations, the thefts. I know about your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.88,0:31:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你根本不知道我父亲 - 退役海军 他在路上的孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know crap about my dad. - Ex-Marine, raised his kids on the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,廉价旅馆 偏僻的木屋 典型的准军事活命至上主义者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheap motels, backwoods cabins. Real paramilitary survivalist type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.80,0:31:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是搞不清楚他到底是什么类型的疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't get a handle on what type of wacko he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.68,0:31:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐居者 晶片植入人 同性恋 变态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}White supremacist, Timmy McVeigh, tomato, tomato.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.31,0:31:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有权利那样说我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no right talking about my dad like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.15,0:31:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个英雄 - 是的 听起来很像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was a hero. - Yeah. Right. Sure sounds like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个小时做决定 不然我们就直接冲进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one hour to make a decision or we come, full automatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.70,0:31:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集你的人 5分钟后 我们进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scramble your men. Five minutes, then we go in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.16,0:32:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？汉迪克森 他们目前为止已经放了一个人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Henriksen, they've let out one hostage so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.66,0:32:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就目前来看他们没有伤害任何人 - 你不了解温彻斯特家的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've hurt no one. - You don't know these Winchesters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们很危险而且受过特殊训练 - 我们不能拿里面人的生命做赌注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're dangerous and expertly trained. - We can't risk all those people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.38,0:32:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信我 迪恩相对于我们的行动更为危险 - 这太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust me. Dean's a risk to them. - This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.01,0:32:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的行为在里面 我们只是去阻止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy's in there and I just hung up on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.13,0:32:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.72,0:32:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.26,0:33:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们外面有点麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a bit of a problem outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.06,0:33:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的麻烦在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a problem in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪莉？我们要放你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherri? We're gonna let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.90,0:33:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么是我？- 对联邦调查员表示友好 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why me? - As a show of good faith to the feds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.91,0:33:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我最好和其它人一起呆在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd rather stay here with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.58,0:33:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我会坚持我的想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm gonna have to insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.81,0:33:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是要放我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were letting me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.94,0:33:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个业余演员 还是天生是块演戏的料？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that community theater or are you naturally like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后一次装成别人 最后一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last time you become anybody. Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.53,0:34:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Oh, God. Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.14,0:34:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 等等 等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wait.wait.wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.31,0:34:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这样做有什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the advantage of this plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说 现在晕倒并不会帮它逃掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, fainting now wouldn't help it survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.10,0:35:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.85,0:35:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她从这儿弄出去 马上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her out of here. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot. Don't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿工作 我在这儿工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work here. I work here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.09,0:36:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.84,0:36:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这带出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get me out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.39,0:36:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.76,0:36:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.94,0:37:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.25,0:38:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear in here. Clear. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.88,0:38:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全 安全 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear. Clear. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.39,0:38:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.81,0:38:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.81,0:38:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,男性 非洲籍美国人 没救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male, African-American. Goner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.23,0:38:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 伙计 我刚刚把他送到银行外了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, man. I just walked her out of the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.15,0:38:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定是有个双胞胎姐妹或者什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must have a twin sister or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.42,0:39:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我的小组报告说这里已经安全了 他们逃掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, my team said it's secure. They're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.96,0:39:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉你的小组把这给我翻个底朝天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell your team to tear it apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.84,0:39:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 管道 棚顶 所有的地方 - 我认为没那必要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ducts, ceiling, furnace, everything. - That's not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.92,0:39:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so screwed.{\r}
